# `quarto use template` copies every file that is not excluded here or by
# Quarto's own built-ins (README.md, LICENSE, and top-level dotfiles). Keep it
# to what a new deck folder needs.
#
# The skills install as a Claude Code plugin rather than being vendored; docs/
# and reports/ are this repo's own published output; tests/ exercise the kit,
# not a deck. Nested dotfiles are not covered by Quarto's `.*` built-in, which
# is anchored at the root, so the caches are listed explicitly.
skills/
docs/
reports/
slides/tests/
slides/_site/
slides/.quarto/
slides/tools/__pycache__/
